  "description": "Operating Area: Greece\n\nStep aboard M/Y BUNKER, a 40m / 131’ CRN masterpiece freshly refitted in 2025 and now one of the most attractive superyachts on the Greek charter market. Designed by Zuccon International Project, BUNKER blends Italian elegance with a completely renewed, contemporary interior and extensive technical upgrades for a smooth, quiet and luxurious cruise. She accommodates up to 12 guests (10 adults and 2 children) in 5 beautifully appointed en-suite cabins. Her style is modern, warm and welcoming: white leather, cherry wood, soft textures and designer furnishings by Roche Bobois are paired with curated modern art and colourful décor. Finest-quality linens, towels and accessories, create the feeling of an exclusive boutique hotel at sea.",
